'''Zero-Gravity Tour''' (無重力体験ツアー, ''Mujūryoku Taiken Tsuā'', '''Zero Gravity Tour''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (L): Cat Cannon will charge 20 seconds faster.

